        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 8996, Delaware Entry Door Lockset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe 9 Inch Delaware Entry Door Lockset with Interconnected Single Cylinder Function has an emergency egress option so that your front door can be opened when locked by simply turning the inside lever or knob. It helps ensure that your family can get out safely in the case of an emergency without having to fiddle with the thumbturn. The Delaware Handleset is available in an array of beautiful finishes. It will fit standard 2-1/8 inch door preparations with door thicknesses ranging from 1-1/4 inches to 2-3/4 inches thick and with backsets of 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches. This Arched Delaware Entry Door Lockset is the perfect traditional finishing touch for any front door.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Delaware Entry Door Lockset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Keyway: Schlage C</li>\r\n<li>Will fit standard 2-1/8\" door preparations.</li>\r\n<li>Solid brass latch with saw-proof insert.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Emtek Delaware 9 Inch Entry Set:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Overall Height: 9\"</li>\r\n<li>Bore Hole Spacing (distance between deadbolt and lever latch): 5-1/2\" Center to Center</li>\r\n<li>Overall Width: 2-7/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Thickness: 3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Doors Thickness: 1-1/4\" - 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt: Full 1\" Throw</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-8996-specifications.pdf?v=1704262346\"><b>Emtek 8996 Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available Functions</b> \r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Full Dummy Set:</b> Trim for non-working doors. It does not latch and does not lock. Usually used as matching trim for the non-working side of double doors.</li>\r\n<li><b>Single Cylinder:</b> From the exterior, a knob/lever operates the handleset latch and a key operates the deadbolt. From the inside, a thumbturn unlocks the deadbolt and a knob/lever operates the latch.</li>\r\n<li><b>Interconnected Single Cylinder:</b> The deadbolt is thrown and retracted by a key from the exterior and a thumbturn from the interior. The interior knob/lever opens the door without having to unlock the deadbolt for immediate egress.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-8996-finish.jpg?v=1704354670\" width=\"600\" height=\"102\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek 8996 Available Finishes\">\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "9 Inch Delaware Entry Door Lockset",
                "description": "The 9 Inch Delaware Entry Door Lockset with Interconnected Single Cylinder Function has an emergency egress option so that your front door can be opened when locked by simply turning the inside lever or knob. It helps ensure that your family can get out safely in the case of an emergency without having to fiddle with the thumbturn. The Delaware Handleset is available in an array of beautiful finishes. It will fit standard 2-1/8 inch door preparations with door thicknesses ranging from 1-1/4 inches to 2-3/4 inches thick and with backsets of 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches. This Arched Delaware Entry Door Lockset is the perfect traditional finishing touch for any front door.",
                "keywords": "Delaware Entry Door Locksets, Delaware Entry Door Locksets, Emtek Delaware 9 Inch Entry Sets, 9 Inch Delaware Entry Door Locksets, Emtek 8996, Emtek 8856, EMT-8996, Arched handlesets, Arched entrysets, traditional handsets, traditional entry sets,"
